  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><img src=\"assets\\st0003_f0f909ffd448.png\" style=\"max-width:\"100%\"; object-fit:contain\" style=\"width:2.42014in;height:2.07361in\" /></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>25</mn><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>z</mi><mi>y</mi></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced open=\"{\" close=\"}\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>&#8757;</mo><mo>&#8710;</mo><mi>L</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>~</mo><mo>&#8710;</mo><mi>P</mi><mi>N</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>z</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>25</mn></mrow></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mo>&#8230;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br />Also, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>100</mn><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>z</mi><mi>x</mi></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced open=\"{\" close=\"}\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>&#8757;</mo><mo>&#8710;</mo><mi>M</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>A</mi><mo>~</mo><mo>&#8710;</mo><mi>P</mi><mi>N</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>z</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>100</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#8230;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br />Adding equation <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>, we get</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mi>z</mi><mn>25</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mi>z</mi><mn>100</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"/><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>20</mn></math></p>"
